mutation.example:
mutation UpdateSkuPrice($id: String!, $input: MutationUpdateSkuPriceInput!) {
  updateSkuPrice(id: $id, input: $input) {
    id value { value currencyCode }
  }
}

query.example:
query skuPrices($skuStatus: SKUStatusFilter, $first: Int, $after: String) {
  skuPrices(skuStatus: $skuStatus, first: $first, after: $after) {
    edges { node { id value { value currencyCode } } }
    pageInfo { hasNextPage endCursor }
  }
}

BulkOperationTransformType.description:
Transform operation type applied in a Query-Transform-Set operations chain.
Supported values:
percentageChange — standard signed percentage change using
`input * (1 + value/100)`, where `value` is this operation's percentage rate
(for example +10 markup or -15 discount);
percentageGrossChange — gross-up/revert transform where `value` is the
percentage rate: when `value >= 0`, `input / (1 - value/100)`; when
`value < 0`, `input * (1 + value/100)` (for cash discounting enable/disable);
add — fixed-amount change using `input + value` (use a negative `value` to
subtract);
round — round to the nearest whole cent;
roundToIncrement — round to a positive increment with an optional mode.
